<% content_for :title, "SAC-PAD" %>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">SAC-PAD scaffold is up</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
    Rails <%= Rails.version %> · Ruby <%= RUBY_VERSION %> · Tailwind v4 · Hotwire.
    This placeholder renders inside the shared shell (sidebar + top bar + content, UX-DR2).
    Modules and the real Organization Dashboard are built in Epics 0.2+.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Foundation checklist</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <li>• Server-rendered Rails + TailAdmin shell</li>
      <li>• Multi-database (queue / cache / cable split in production)</li>
      <li>• Foundational gems installed (Devise, Pundit, closure_tree, acts_as_tenant, …)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
